"<div class=\"ex\">5{0} − 3 ifadesinde:<br>5{1} → terim, <b>5</b> → katsayı<br>−3 → sabit terim</div>":"<div class=\"ex\">In 5{0} − 3:<br>5{1} → term, <b>5</b> → coefficient<br>−3 → constant term</div>",
"Benzer terimler":"Like terms",
"Sadece <b>aynı harfli</b> terimler toplanır:\n       <div class=\"ex\">3{0} + 5{1} − 2{2} = (3 + 5 − 2){3} = <b>6{4}</b></div>\n       <div class=\"ex\">4{5} + 7 + 2{6} − 3 = <b>6{7} + 4</b></div>\n       <div class=\"tip\">🐙 Sekiz: Ahtapotlarla ahtapotları, balıklarla balıkları say! 3{8} + 2 ≠ 5{9}</div>":"Only terms with <b>the same letter</b> can be added together:\n       <div class=\"ex\">3{0} + 5{1} − 2{2} = (3 + 5 − 2){3} = <b>6{4}</b></div>\n       <div class=\"ex\">4{5} + 7 + 2{6} − 3 = <b>6{7} + 4</b></div>\n       <div class=\"tip\">🐙 Inky: Count octopuses with octopuses and fish with fish! 3{8} + 2 ≠ 5{9}</div>",
"Dağılma özelliği":"The distributive property",
