"<div class=\"ex\">3({0} − 2) = 12<br>İki tarafı 3'e böl: {1} − 2 = 4<br>İki tarafa 2 ekle: {2} = <b>6</b></div>":"<div class=\"ex\">3({0} − 2) = 12<br>Divide both sides by 3: {1} − 2 = 4<br>Add 2 to both sides: {2} = <b>6</b></div>",
